{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：14:46 2026-06-05 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"女子上吊亡，警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/554e32d08098f9c0f0ffdc8961ae3b0f/2026-06/5.jpeg\"/>\n<p>今（5日）中午1時22分，黃大仙樂富公園旁的天后聖母古廟旁一條樓梯，一名女子在該處以尼龍繩上吊，途人見狀報警求助，女事主昏迷送往廣華醫院，惜經搶救後證實不治。</p>\n<p>現場樓梯遺下一罐酒及一包煙，警方調查後相信死者為59歲姓何女子，現場未見遺書，其輕生原因仍待了解。</p>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3df685831260450cc31e91e4a2903ff4/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-05_at_14_08_04.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a71332683e89923928ec66a26a11b7c9/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-05_at_14_08_03.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員檢走上吊用的尼龍繩。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/659e98fa37c3628947fd96741e0fc317/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-05_at_14_07_46.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"梯間遺下啤酒與香煙。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/46f5cb3da54093536b7e3e0671082cf8/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-05_at_14_07_44_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女子在樂富公園古廟旁一條樓梯上吊亡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d9076ad16986a45c506c956ffa5dfa37/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-05_at_14_07_44_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/75198830a1b5acc56ef4f8d1f0fc4e1b/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-05_at_14_07_44.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-05T10:56:04.403450+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}